[Observation]:
  - Standard 4-way DORA handshake executed cleanly: DHCPDISCOVER -> DHCPOFFER -> DHCPREQUEST -> DHCPACK.
  - All workstations received dynamic IP, subnet mask, default gateway, and DNS server addresses.
  - Cross-router static routing remained 100% operational with dynamic client endpoints.
